{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】石鼓洲焚化廠上月發生三級火，消防處調查指起火原因可能與燒焊工程或吸煙有關。</p>\n<p>消防處完成現場搜證及向相關人士錄取口供，發現起火地點位於I PARK1焚化爐大樓第三焚化模組的高層位置，調查結果已排除與電力故障、蓄意縱火及化學物質自燃有關。消防處完成報告，並轉交環保署跟進。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T09:11:37.253206+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:46:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:59.058518+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T09:04:59.058518+00:00","content_hash":"337be5afc2070f667c0fe6c9b2fa950ab2d293162f625d17e30bedccec3e1ea2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}